  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work in Freedom 2 (Tackling modern slavery and human trafficking)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce vunerabilility to trafficking and forced labour of women and girls across migration pathways leading to the care sector and textiles, clothing, leather and footwear industries of South Asia and the Arab States. At least 350,000 women and girls will be reached at source and destination in India, Nepal, Bangladesh, Oman, Bahrain, Lebanon and Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
